<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#090609">
<title>For My Jaann ❤️</title>
<style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth}
body{
 margin:0;
 font-family:Georgia,"Times New Roman",serif;
 background:
 radial-gradient(ellipse at top,#351020 0%,transparent 55%),
 linear-gradient(145deg,#080608,#160812,#090609);
 color:#fff0f6;
 text-align:center;
 overflow-x:hidden;
}
.screen{
 min-height:100vh;
 display:flex;
 justify-content:center;
 align-items:center;
 padding:22px;
 position:relative;
 z-index:1;
}
.card{
 width:100%;
 max-width:680px;
 padding:32px 22px;
 border:1px solid rgba(255,105,160,.25);
 border-radius:25px;
 background:rgba(23,9,19,.88);
 box-shadow:0 0 45px rgba(155,20,75,.16);
}
h1{
 color:#ff79ad;
 font-size:clamp(30px,7vw,43px);
 text-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(255,70,140,.35);
}
h2{
 color:#ff91ba;
 font-size:27px;
}
p{
 font-size:17px;
 line-height:1.9;
 color:#f3dce6;
}
button{
 border:1px solid #ff8db8;
 background:linear-gradient(135deg,#b51f5b,#68102f);
 color:white;
 padding:14px 25px;
 border-radius:30px;
 font-size:16px;
 margin:9px 4px;
 cursor:pointer;
 box-shadow:0 0 20px rgba(220,35,105,.18);
}
button:active{transform:scale(.97)}
.gift{font-size:75px}
.photo{
 width:100%;
 max-width:450px;
 border-radius:18px;
 margin:15px auto;
 display:block;
 border:1px solid rgba(255,125,175,.4);
 box-shadow:0 0 25px rgba(180,25,85,.16);
}
.divider{
 width:65%;
 height:1px;
 background:linear-gradient(90deg,transparent,#ff79ad,transparent);
 margin:34px auto;
}
.big{font-size:48px}
.signature{
 color:#ff8db8;
 font-size:21px;
 font-weight:bold;
}
.music{
 font-size:13px;
 color:#c9a9b8;
}
#surprise{display:none}
.fade{animation:fade 1.2s ease}
@keyframes fade{
 from{opacity:0;transform:translateY(22px)}
 to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}
}
.heart{
 position:fixed;
 bottom:-35px;
 color:#ff548f;
 text-shadow:0 0 12px #b51f5b;
 animation:float 7s linear forwards;
 pointer-events:none;
 z-index:0;
}
@keyframes float{
 0%{transform:translateY(0) rotate(0);opacity:0}
 15%{opacity:.65}
 100%{transform:translateY(-110vh) rotate(35deg);opacity:0}
}
.secret{
 display:none;
 margin-top:25px;
 padding:22px 15px;
 border:1px solid rgba(255,125,175,.4);
 border-radius:18px;
 background:rgba(70,12,38,.45);
 animation:fade 1s ease;
}
.secret p{font-size:18px}
.small{
 font-size:12px;
 color:#bd9baa;
}
audio{width:100%;max-width:330px;margin:12px auto}
@media(max-width:480px){
 .card{padding:26px 17px}
 p{font-size:16px}
 h2{font-size:24px}
 .photo{max-width:100%}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div id="opening" class="screen">
 <div class="card fade">
  <div class="gift">🎁</div>
  <p class="small">A LITTLE WORLD MADE JUST FOR YOU</p>
  <h1>For My Jaann ❤️</h1>
  <p>
   I made something just for you 🥺
   <br>Ek chhota sa surprise hai tumhare liye
   <br><br>
   Before you open this
   <br>bas ek baar smile kar dena 🙈❤️
  </p>
  <button onclick="openSurprise()">Open Your Surprise ❤️</button>
  <br>
  <button onclick="playMusic()">🎵 Play Music</button>
  <p class="music">Tap karke music enjoy karna, meri jaann 🎶</p>
 </div>
</div>
<div id="surprise">
<div class="screen">
<div class="card fade">
<div class="big">🎂❤️</div>
<h1>Happy Birthday My Jaann ❤️</h1>
<p>
Happy Birthday meri jaan ❤️
<br><br>
Aaj ka din mere liye bhi bohot special hai
because aaj ke din meri life ka sabse special person duniya mein aaya tha
<br><br>
I just want you to know ki tum mere liye kitni important ho
<br>
Tumhari smile mere liye bohot matter karti hai ❤️
</p>
<div class="divider"></div>
<h2>I'm Really Sorry 😭</h2>
<p>
Jaann I know pichle kuch days hum dono ke liye easy nahi the
<br>
Maine tumhe hurt kiya and honestly I am really sorry 😭
<br><br>
I know sirf sorry bolne se sab kuch ekdum theek nahi ho jayega
<br>
But I genuinely want to make things better
<br>
I really don't want to lose you 🥺
<br><br>
Sometimes mujhe samajh nahi aata ki main apni feelings properly kaise express karu
<br>
But you really mean a lot to me
<br><br>
Main chahta hoon tumhe sirf meri baaton se nahi, mere actions se bhi pyaar aur care feel ho ❤️
</p>
<div class="divider"></div>
<h2>Our Memories ❤️</h2>
<img src="photo1.jpg.JPG" class="photo" alt="Our Memory One"
onerror="this.style.display='none'">
<p>
Ye photo dekh ke bas ek hi cheez yaad aati hai
<br>
I wish main us moment mein tumhare paas hota
<br><br>
Distance ke wajah se hum har moment saath nahi reh paate
<br>
But still tum mere dil ke bohot close ho ❤️
</p>
<div class="divider"></div>
<h2>Even From Far Away 🥺</h2>
<img src="photo2.jpg.jpg" class="photo" alt="Our Memory Two"
onerror="this.style.display='none'">
<p>
Tum mujhse door ho but meri feelings tumhare liye kabhi door nahi hui
<br><br>
I don't want this birthday to be just another birthday wish from a distance
<br>
I want to be there with you
<br>
See your smile
<br>
Celebrate with you
<br>
And make memories together ❤️
</p>
<div class="divider"></div>
<h2>My Dua For You 🤲🏻</h2>
<p>
Allah tumhe hamesha khush rakhe
<br>
Tumhari har dua qubool kare
<br>
May you always have a reason to smile
<br><br>
And my biggest dua is that InshaAllah
<br>
one day this distance between us ends 🤲🏻❤️
</p>
<div class="divider"></div>
<h2>My Future Wife ❤️</h2>
<p>
I don't want to celebrate only one birthday with you
<br>
I want to celebrate all your birthdays with you InshaAllah ❤️
<br><br>
Aaj hum door hain
<br>
But I hope ek din aisa aaye jab birthday wish karne ke liye phone ki zarurat hi na pade
<br>
Kyunki main tumhare saamne rahu ❤️
</p>
<div class="divider"></div>
<h2>One Last Thing ❤️</h2>
<p>
No matter how many fights we have
<br>
No matter kitne bhi difficult days aaye
<br>
I still want us
<br><br>
I still want you
<br>
And I still pray that one day we will be together forever InshaAllah ❤️
</p>
<div class="divider"></div>
<h2>Happy Birthday Once Again ❤️</h2>
<p>
I hope aaj tum bohot smile karo
<br>
Khush raho
<br>
Aur hamesha aise hi beautiful raho ❤️
<br><br>
InshaAllah ek din ye distance bhi khatam ho jayega
<br>
Aur phir birthdays hum saath celebrate karenge
</p>
<p class="signature">
Happy Birthday My Jaann ❤️
<br><br>
I Love You So Much 🫂❤️
</p>
<div class="divider"></div>
<h2>Waittt My Jaann 🥺💌</h2>
<p>Jaane se pehle ek last surprise hai tumhare liye...</p>
<button onclick="showSecret()">Open Your Last Surprise 💌</button>
<div id="secret" class="secret">
 <div class="big">🫂❤️</div>
 <h2>Ek Promise, Meri Jaann</h2>
 <p>
  Main tumse ye promise nahi karunga ki humare beech kabhi problems nahi aayengi
  <br><br>
  Bas itna promise karna chahta hoon ki main apni galtiyon ko samajhne ki koshish karunga
  aur tumhe apni care feel karane ke liye khud bhi effort karunga
  <br><br>
  Tumhe har baar apni importance yaad dilani na pade
  main chahta hoon ki tumhe mere actions se bhi pata chale ❤️
  <br><br>
  Happy Birthday meri jaann
  <br>
  Allah tumhe hamesha khush rakhe
  <br>
  Ameen 🤲🏻❤️
 </p>
 <div class="signature">Always with love, Affan ❤️</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<audio id="bgMusic" loop preload="none" playsinline>
 <source src="dekha-hi-nahi.mp3.mp3" type="audio/mpeg">
</audio>
<script>
const music=document.getElementById("bgMusic");
function playMusic(){
 music.play().then(()=>{
  const btns=document.querySelectorAll("button");
  btns.forEach(btn=>{
   if(btn.innerText.includes("Play Music")){
    btn.innerText="🎵 Music Playing";
   }
  });
 }).catch(()=>{
  alert("Music start karne ke liye button dobara tap karo 🎵");
 });
}
function openSurprise(){
 document.getElementById("opening").style.display="none";
 document.getElementById("surprise").style.display="block";
 window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:"smooth"});
 music.play().catch(()=>{});
}
function showSecret(){
 const secret=document.getElementById("secret");
 secret.style.display="block";
 secret.scrollIntoView({behavior:"smooth",block:"center"});
}
function createHeart(){
 const heart=document.createElement("div");
 heart.className="heart";
 heart.innerHTML=["❤️","♡","💗"][Math.floor(Math.random()*3)];
 heart.style.left=Math.random()*100+"vw";
 heart.style.fontSize=(14+Math.random()*18)+"px";
 heart.style.animationDuration=(5+Math.random()*5)+"s";
 document.body.appendChild(heart);
 setTimeout(()=>heart.remove(),10000);
}
setInterval(createHeart,650);
</script>
</body>
</html>
